WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.302 --> 00:00:01.830
(soothing music)

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:04.080
- [Narrator] In a case that
has shaken Silicon Valley,

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.720
Nima Momeni pleaded not guilty to murder

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.530
in the April 4th stabbing
of cash app founder Bob Lee.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.780
- The reason the story
is really interesting

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:17.670
is because it shows this whole
other side of San Francisco

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:21.060
that a lot of people are
not paying attention to.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:22.230
- [Narrator] Initially thought by many

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.600
to be a random attack
on the tech executive,

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.390
here's a look at how Bob Lee
knew his alleged attacker

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:29.910
Nima Momeni and what
prosecutors say happened

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:31.180
the night Bob was killed

00:00:33.009 --> 00:00:35.550
(bright music)

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.910
- Bob Lee was a brilliant
computer programmer.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:42.150
He is not a name that a lot
of people would recognize,

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:44.910
but he was really influential in a lot

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:48.180
of tech companies out
here in San Francisco.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:53.180
There's a lot less known about
Nima Momeni and his family.

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:57.570
He immigrated along with
his sister Khazar Momeni

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.460
and ended up in the Bay Area.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:04.200
Khazar was in the same circles as Bob Lee

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.630
in this kind of lifestyle circle,

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.660
where there's quite a lot of partying,

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:14.070
recreational drug use,
different sexual partners

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:15.300
things like that.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.650
- [Narrator] Bob's wife, Krista Lee,

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:19.320
whom he was close with, even
though they were separated,

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:21.150
disputed that he was a party boy

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:23.820
and said Bob was more mature than that.

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.460
- Nima and Khazar were very close,

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:31.460
and Nima was kind of
overprotective of his sister

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:34.020
a lot of the friends have told us,

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:38.160
he was often out with her when
she was at the party scene.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:41.280
- [Narrator] On April 13th,
authorities arrested Nima.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.500
- I am here today to formally announce

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.680
the charges against Mr. Nima Momeni

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:48.960
for the murder of Bob Lee.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:50.010
- [Narrator] In court documents

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:51.870
prosecutors paint a detailed picture

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:53.190
of what they allege happened

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:55.440
in the hours leading up to Bob's death.

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:57.690
Prosecutors say that Bob and Khazar met

00:01:57.690 --> 00:01:59.880
up at a house party on April 3rd,

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:01.530
Nima was also there.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:03.540
- What happens next is kind of

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:06.270
a confusing timeline of events.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:10.230
The important thing to
note is that at some point

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:15.230
Nima Momeni, Khazar's
brother confronts Bob Lee

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:20.190
and says did anything
inappropriate happen at that party?

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:21.570
Were there drugs?

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.070
Did anything else happen?

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:26.250
And Bob assures him that, no

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:28.560
nothing inappropriate happened,

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:30.270
everything is fine.

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:33.120
- Later Bob ended up
at Khazar's apartment,

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:35.250
again Nima was there.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.800
Prosecutors say surveillance
footage shows Bob

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.070
and Nima leaving the apartment
together in a white BMW.

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:45.510
- Basically they're alleging
that Nima drives the car

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:48.390
to a secluded spot nearby

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:53.070
and stabs Bob to death
with a kitchen knife.

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:55.590
- [Narrator] Prosecutors claim
Bob was left on the street.

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:57.870
He called 911, but it was too late

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:00.330
and he was pronounced
dead at the hospital.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:02.040
According to Bob's autopsy report

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:05.760
he was stabbed three times,
one blow piercing his heart.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:08.430
The report also revealed
that Bob had several drugs

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:11.133
in his system, including
cocaine and Ketamine.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:16.140
Nima Momeni entered a plea of not guilty

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:19.710
on May 18th and is being
detained ahead of trial.

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:22.050
- My defense is it's a combination

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:26.520
of an accident and
self-defense, absolutely.

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:29.270
- [Reporter] It was an accident
with three stab wounds?

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:35.480
- Well, you know, I'm
gonna say my defense is

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.600
it is an accident

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:44.250
with a cross between
self-defense an accident.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:48.573
There was no premeditation,
deliberation, absolutely not.

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:50.790
- There's no question in our minds

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.680
that we have charged the correct person

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:54.420
who killed Mr. Lee

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.500
- [Narrator] In a written statement.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.590
Lawyers for Khazar said "There
are many rumors circulating

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.080
around this case, many of them untrue.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:03.420
Ms. Momeni loves and supports her brother.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:05.520
What happened here is a tragedy."

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:08.580
- The fact that Bob may
have been sleeping according

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.710
to his friends with Khazar,

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:14.910
the fact that Nima was
very protective of Khazar.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:17.580
These things probably
matter in this situation,

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:20.670
but a lot more details about this case

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:23.401
are going to unfold in the coming weeks.

00:04:23.401 --> 00:04:25.984
(bright music)

